am."}, "view": {"type": "string", "enum": ["editing", "full", "excerpts"], "description": "Without selectors, editing returns every complete canonical block with IDs, hashes, metadata and available sequence guards; omits only duplicate whole-document Markdown and attribution. Unselected editing content over 128 KiB compact UTF-8 structured JSON returns page_read_selection_required with no content; use selectors, excerpts or full view. Full also returns those omitted fields. Editing/full never clip block text. Excerpts requires search: exact LF-line evidence in block_excerpts plus full block hashes. Incomplete excerpts are not replacement Markdown; use guarded literal patches, whose old strings must be unique in the entire block."}}, "required": ["page_id"], "additionalProperties": false}}, "mcp__spaces__list_page_automations": {"description": "Read, search, create, and edit pages and spaces in ChatGPT Space, within your current account.

